@APIkey_HostAddress = http://localhost:5009
@ApiKey = ROBE-LINGO-KEY-1234

### Obtener todos los productos (con API Key)
GET {{APIkey_HostAddress}}/api/products
Accept: application/json
X-API-KEY: {{ApiKey}}

###

### Intentar obtener productos sin API Key (debe retornar 401 Unauthorized)
GET {{APIkey_HostAddress}}/api/products
Accept: application/json

###

### Obtener producto por ID
GET {{APIkey_HostAddress}}/api/products/1
Accept: application/json
X-API-KEY: {{ApiKey}}

###

### Crear un nuevo producto
POST {{APIkey_HostAddress}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-KEY: {{ApiKey}}

{
  "productName": "Nuevo Producto de Prueba",
  "unitPrice": 19.99,
  "unitsInStock": 50,
  "discontinued": false
}

###

### Actualizar un producto existente
PUT {{APIkey_HostAddress}}/api/products/1
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-KEY: {{ApiKey}}

{
  "productId": 1,
  "productName": "Producto Modificado",
  "unitPrice": 25.00,
  "unitsInStock": 45,
  "discontinued": false
}

###

### Eliminar un producto
DELETE {{APIkey_HostAddress}}/api/products/1
X-API-KEY: {{ApiKey}}

###
